      "content": "thanks for saying that. but it's not just being sad... its like the core of me is just empty. even when i sleep i wake up feeling like i've already lost a battle. i feel like im just a ghost going through the motions of a life i don't even want anymore. everything is just so loud and constant and i just want it to be quiet. i just want to be still.",
