      "content": "but the \"resting\" doesnt work. i try to rest, i try to take breaks, i try to do everything people say to feel better, but the quiet never comes. it's like the noise is inside me. i just feel like i'm running a race that has no finish line, and i'm just so, so tired of running. i keep thinking... what if the only way to actually get that stillness you're talking about is to just... stop everything? permanently?",
